{"id":"309c79edc352c7510a93ebb30a2792fa0e0b4e41831bbf439f4dbace6329b331","pubkey":"23395bce1a18fe5ff5bde153fcd47ecd1cd66e686684dfd2cfcbd9fafd305cb3","created_at":1781742569,"content":"今朝の体重は94.3キロ！順調に減ってきてるぞ！\n\nhttps://image.nostr.build/ee6af3ee4c9187754e525936b615ff5f92d5f6e98cf91857e0b27ae4402c1bd1.jpg","tags":[["imeta","url https://image.nostr.build/ee6af3ee4c9187754e525936b615ff5f92d5f6e98cf91857e0b27ae4402c1bd1.jpg","blurhash eCS6MfE1o#t7WBs9%2%MaeR%01WExva}Rj4-Rixaj[WBD*xuxvWCWB","dim 1320x2868"],["r","https://image.nostr.build/ee6af3ee4c9187754e525936b615ff5f92d5f6e98cf91857e0b27ae4402c1bd1.jpg"],["client","Damus"]]}
