{"id":"f9a4895343200d918a6e939f146cfb452dc012fb2283c3cb73e557f4866d2feb","pubkey":"813a2cfda49a8801e21bed3c2380e786fa4cad753dd15b1af19a37a815579579","created_at":1781739051,"content":"Was live earlier on nostr:nprofile1qyt8wumn8ghj7mn0wd68yetvd96x2uewdaexwtcpz4mhxue69uhhyetvv9ujuerpd46hxtnfduhsqgy9muq29a4frpzn2nyd9k0m4dqq9wu9ks39ht4tvra0kfv8c5pcagxg0wze  from my newly found morning routine ☕️☀️\n\nAs part of balancing life, work, and adventures, I've found it helps to start the day a little slower - a favourite morning beverage in hand, some sunlight, a bit of movement, and space to think before the world starts asking for things.\n\nCreating that space and flexibility for ourselves isn't always easy. Perhaps that's part of the freedom we're all working toward.\n\nDo you have a morning routine?\n\nReplay below 👇\n\nI go live from time to time to share little moments like these. Feel free to tune in next time and say hi 💜\n https://blossom.primal.net/f933beda720d29b771170690cf070349b1d992222d3ba830cb1ac012a3be92e0.png \nhttps://shosho.live/ivylumi","tags":[["p","85df00a2f6a91845354c8d2d9fbab4002bb85b4225baeab60fafb2587c5038ea","wss://nostrelites.org/","mention"],["r","wss://sendit.nosflare.com/"],["r","wss://relay.ditto.pub/"],["r","wss://relay.dreamith.to/"],["r","wss://nostr.wine/"],["r","wss://relay.momostr.pink/"],["r","wss://nos.lol/"],["r","wss://relay.mostr.pub/"],["r","wss://purplepag.es/"],["r","wss://relay.primal.net/"],["r","wss://relay.damus.io/"],["imeta","url https://blossom.primal.net/f933beda720d29b771170690cf070349b1d992222d3ba830cb1ac012a3be92e0.png","m image/png","dim 4000x6000","service nip96"],["client","Primal Web"]]}
