{"id":"1edeb274a35f83ddd6600765aae38c6455e144735423186c54f4bb2f02bb9b9a","pubkey":"ec9bd7465546ba061f5dfde716a4f20f3f27ecc28ca4870775e5e853df11a9d0","created_at":1781728913,"content":"https://otherstuff.shaving.kiwi/a091a0d9603e7d2369e9a1b3eb7729de5b340338f0e9137ca28fa57616d1cdda.webp I added this amazingly funny stone to my set of fetishes I keep on my desk. The way I got it was very random: I was already leaving #BTCPrague when I noticed a familiar hat of nostr:nprofile1qqsgjcqdt0lgk8fdh0w6a3c9ew7de95gjw2gm2cj2f4em9t6a8e0pngpr9mhxue69uhhyetvv9ujuumwdae8gtnnda3kjctv9uq32amnwvaz7tmwdaehgu3wv3kx2u3wvdhk6tcpzdmhxue69uhhqatjwpkx2urpvuhx2ue0tcwnjk  and wanted to say goodbye, but he was busy solving some pressing issue, so I sat down next to nostr:nprofile1qqsrat92w6pjd47uaq8kact6mgveh6l8av7p5c9nnv2wpfvthtrxleqppemhxue69uhkummn9ekx7mp0qy2hwumn8ghj7un9d3shjtnyv9kh2uewd9hj7qgswaehxw309ahx7um5wghx6mmd9umpa6zc  to wait a bit. Sitting across from me were nostr:nprofile1qqspvldf3h2rfgdnkuyx98f6vv894h0gca2grda2wasnf6gu2xx6zqqpzamhxue69uhhyetvv9ujuurjd9kkzmpwdejhgtcpz4mhxue69uhhyetvv9ujuerpd46hxtnfduhsz9mhwden5te0wfjkccte9ehx7um5wghxyctwvshsx65mg0  and nostr:nprofile1qqswc7d4dz775c72vzgltwztp33ecy9qjx0pwhaqnfx7x920s2gx7fgpz4mhxue69uhhyetvv9ujuerpd46hxtnfduhsz9mhwden5te0wfjkccte9ec8y6tdv9kzumn9wshsz9mhwden5te0wfjkccte9cc8scmgv96zucm0d5hsg2f6cg, and they were talking about their amazing art. It was a short but very inspiring moment, and then before I left I got this pebble. There is a special engraving on the other side of the Plebl, but I will keep that mystery for myself.","tags":[["alt","A short note: https://otherstuff.shaving.kiwi/a091a0d9603e7d2369..."],["p","89600d5bfe8b1d2dbbddaec705cbbcdc968893948dab12526b9d957ae9f2f0cd","wss://relay.snort.social/"],["p","3eacaa768326d7dce80f6ee17ada199bebe7eb3c1a60b39b14e0a58bbac66fe4","wss://nos.lol/"],["p","167da98dd434a1b3b708629d3a630e5adde8c75481b7aa776134e91c518da100","wss://relay.primal.net/"],["p","ec79b568bdea63ca6091f5b84b0c639