{"id":"4391852077c624d5268a09ddfc179a49b3dab0a936a304dc3518b4b5113c7b99","pubkey":"f0ff87e7796ba86fc84b4807b25a5dee206d724c6f61aa8853975a39deeeff58","created_at":1781695324,"content":"The current government will never get power again. After the next election we will get a right wing government. I'm really hoping for Restore. Rupert Lowe is a guy who comes across very genuine unlike Farage.\n\nRestore is the fastest growing party in British history. Some of their policies include repealing the Online Safety Act, removing the facial recognition cameras, scrapping Digital ID, and banning CBDCs.\n\nRupert himself often references Heyak and advocates for slashing the size of the state.\n\nAgain this is an extremely popular party which recently won nine seats in local elections. That's every seat they stood in.\n\nThe current government does not have the support of the people. Keir Stalin has the lowest approval rating of any leader in British history.\n\nThings will get a lot better in the future.\n\nHighly recommend this interview:\n\nhttps://youtu.be/bwbZVlLSe8A","tags":[["alt","A short note: The current government will never get power again...."],["e","0d95af391f63daac81d95ed78f28409920949af3ecf122c07e904937321d839c","wss://nostr.wine/","root","bb90e7f0531d4abaa39ff85091577434fb6fd3aff9cfb8da275199e241eb4eff"],["e","b72a12029efb6c16005168f7918a20d7a3b5e5fada7c7c708c0349e3619628a9","wss://relay.damus.io/","reply","61066504617ee79387021e18c89fb79d1ddbc3e7bff19cf2298f40466f8715e9"],["p","b360b1db7763c86385a0c24b969fead7a8a40023368eb723c00d2706f80bca27","wss://nsite.run/"],["p","3f770d65d3a764a9c5cb503ae123e62ec7598ad035d836e2a810f3877a745b24","wss://nos.lol/"],["p","bb90e7f0531d4abaa39ff85091577434fb6fd3aff9cfb8da275199e241eb4eff","wss://njump.me/"],["p","61066504617ee79387021e18c89fb79d1ddbc3e7bff19cf2298f40466f8715e9","wss://relay.mostr.pub/"],["r","https://youtu.be/bwbZVlLSe8A"],["client","Amethyst"]]}
