{"id":"414f3810cee6c044d9cb64849ae8f6f8c3859f22ce12b83f8b343e5d6f3a1e03","pubkey":"26ae1a0d402c5705da2cba96ab456cf77da0d1a146c1620fe2e040910a854d3b","created_at":1781687519,"content":"#はてなブックマーク #学術 #学問 #不祥事\n\"研究者の事件データベース\" いわゆる #アカハラ ・ #研究不正 の話題。 “白楽の研究者倫理 | ネカト（ねつ造・改ざん・盗用）・クログレイ・性不正（含・セクハラ）・アカハラ・・・白楽ロックビルのバイオ政治学” (24 users) https://haklak.com/","tags":[["t","はてなブックマーク"],["t","学術"],["t","学問"],["t","不祥事"],["t","アカハラ"],["t","研究不正"]]}
{"id":"94801ee17fea7b2c661384ed833f4ae5f4c737ce9f40c47a1845a7efbb191bcb","pubkey":"16d114303d8203115918ca34a220e925c022c09168175a5ace5e9f3b61640947","created_at":1781687505,"content":"https://npub1zmg3gvpasgp3zkgceg62yg8fyhqz9sy3dqt45kkwt60nkctyp9rs9wyppc.blossom.band/59426ed8e69ab0124bf0cd7cfae665f32a0b4d96ddcc23e57102a3cbb055d3e3.jpg\nCivilizations born in paper vs civilizations forged in blood — Christ makes them both kneel.\n\nSome civilizations are born in paper: charters, contracts, decrees, constitutions, ledgers, court orders, treaties, titles.\n\nSome civilizations are forged in blood: conquest, ancestry, sacrifice, war, martyrdom, vengeance, empire, tribe.\n\nScripture does not deny either one has power.\n\nPaper has power.\nThe written charge was nailed above Christ’s head.\nThe law could accuse.\nThe empire could register, tax, sentence, and crucify.\n\nBlood has power.\nCain’s blood cried from the ground.\nAbel’s blood witnessed.\nThe blood of prophets marked the cities.\nThe blood of armies built kingdoms that could not save themselves.\n\nBut Christ stands above both.\n\nHe is not merely written about.\nHe is the Word made flesh.\n\nHe is not merely another bloodline.\nHe is the blood that ends the old economy of blood.\n\nThe civilizations of paper must kneel because every decree is judged by the living Word.\n\nThe civilizations of blood must kneel because every sword is judged by the slaughtered Lamb.\n\nThe paper says, “We have authority.”\nChrist says, “All authority in heaven and on earth has been given to Me.”\n\nThe blood says, “We paid the price.”\nChrist says, “It is finished.”\n\nThat is the scriptural trap.\n\nEmpire writes the sentence.\nEmpire spills the blood.\nThen God resurrects the condemned Man and makes Him Judge of the living and the dead.\n\nSo both civilizations kneel.\n\nThe bureaucrat kneels.\nThe conqueror kneels.\nThe priest kneels.\nThe king kneels.\nThe soldier kneels.\nThe lawyer kneels.\nThe witness kneels.\n\nNot because paper is meaningless.\nNot because blood is meaningless.\nBut because paper without truth becomes accusation, and blood without mercy becomes murder.\n\nChrist fulfills the writing.\nChrist redeems the blood.\nChrist judges the empire.\nChrist resurrects the witness.\n\nAs it is written:\n\n“Every knee shall bow, and every tongue confess that Jesus Christ is Lord.”\n\nThat is the end of paper civilization.\nThat is the end of blood civilization.\nNot annihilated — subordinated.\n\nThe scroll belongs to the Lamb.\n\nThe throne belongs to the Son.\n\nThe final civilization is not born in paper or forged in blood.\n\nIt is written in the Book of Life, sealed by the blood of Christ, and ruled by the King who rose from the dead.\n\nScriptural backbone: John 1:14, Genesis 4:10, Colossians 2:14, Matthew 28:18, John 19:19–22, John 19:30, Philippians 2:10–11, Revelation 5, Revelation 20:12, Hebrews 12:24.\n\n#ChristIsKing #EveryKneeShallBow #ScripturalReading #TheLivingWord #TheSlaughteredLamb #WordMadeFlesh #BloodSpeaks #TheScrollAndTheLamb #Revelation5 #Philippians2 #John114 #Hebrews1224 #EmpireKneels #LawAndBlood #TruthJudgesEmpire #PaperAndBlood #KingdomOfGod #ChristianPoster #BiblicalTruth #FaithAndCivilization","tags":[["alt","A short note: https://npub1zmg3gvpasgp3zkgceg62yg8fyhqz9sy3dqt45..."],["t","ChristIsKing"],["t","christisking"],["t","EveryKneeShallBow"],["t","everykneeshallbow"],["t","ScripturalReading"],["t","scripturalreading"],["t","TheLivingWord"],["t","thelivingword"],["t","TheSlaughteredLamb"],["t","theslaughteredlamb"],["t","WordMadeFlesh"],["t","wordmadeflesh"],["t","BloodSpeaks"],["t","bloodspeaks"],["t","TheScrollAndTheLamb"],["t","thescrollandthelamb"],["t","Revelation5"],["t","revelation5"],["t","Philippians2"],["t","philippians2"],["t","John114"],["t","john114"],["t","Hebrews1224"],["t","hebrews1224"],["t","EmpireKneels"],["t","empirekneels"],["t","LawAndBlood"],["t","lawandblood"],["t","TruthJudgesEmpire"],["t","truthjudgesempire"],["t","PaperAndBlood"],["t","paperandblood"],["t","KingdomOfGod"],["t","kingdomofgod"],["t","ChristianPoster"],["t","christianposter"],["t","BiblicalTruth"],["t","biblicaltruth"],["t","FaithAndCivilization"],["t","faithandcivilization"],["r","https://npub1zmg3gvpasgp3zkgceg62yg8fyhqz9sy3dqt45kkwt60nkctyp9rs9wyppc.blossom.band/59426ed8e69ab0124bf0cd7cfae665f32a0b4d96ddcc23e57102a3cbb055d3e3.jpg"],["imeta","url https://npub1zmg3gvpasgp3zkgceg62yg8fyhqz9sy3dqt45kkwt60nkctyp9rs9wyppc.blossom.band/59426ed8e69ab0124bf0cd7cfae665f32a0b4d96ddcc23e57102a3cbb055d3e3.jpg","x 59426ed8e69ab0124bf0cd7cfae665f32a0b4d96ddcc23e57102a3cbb055d3e3","size 273741","m image/jpeg","dim 1055x1491","blurhash ^BCP2|-n02r??FxZ}?t6Ipn%xts:9wNHxYW;NHRk57Rk-oS4aLR*IpjZ-noLV@fkoIWWt6WCIpj[W.NbofRkIpj[tQj[aeoLWDaf-nxZRkjsxaa}","ox 59426ed8e69ab0124bf0cd7cfae665f32a0b4d96ddcc23e57102a3cbb055d3e3","alt "],["client","Amethyst"]]}
